        <p>
          Being <a href="https://pflag.org/glossary/" target="_blank" class="text-secondary font-bold hover:underline">2SLGBTQIA+</a> (two-spirit, lesbian, gay, bisexual, transgender, queer, intersex, asexual, plus) in STEM can be isolating. In an effort to build community and bring together Queer and Trans folks, a group of advocates and scientists have built the Pride in Microbiology Network.
        </p>
